# Compare at a CI-sized scale (M7): two generated versions of a 2,000-line text with changed,
# removed, added and moved lines. The diff runs on a worker, every row with a line on both
# sides is level, and the views scroll together. perf-compare.stet-test has the 10,000-line
# exit criterion.

write-generated $TMP/old.txt lines-old 90000
write-generated $TMP/new.txt lines-new 90000
open old.txt new.txt
heartbeat-start
action compare
wait-compare
report-compare
assert-compare-under 1000 5000
wait-idle-low
assert-compare-aligned
assert-compare-line new 8 changed
assert-compare-line old 14 removed
assert-compare-line old 201 moved
assert-max-block 1000

# Scrolling one view scrolls the other level, both ways.
scroll-to-line 1500
wait-frames 2
assert-scroll-level
view-focus 2
scroll-to-line 400
wait-frames 2
assert-scroll-level
action next-difference
wait-frames 2
assert-scroll-level
assert-focus editor
